	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12760"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 146<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12760#msg12760"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1273.msg12760#msg12760">Re: Sibling Punishment. . .?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #25 on:</b> November 19, 2004, 12:33:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							15 year olds are plenty old enough to babysit.&nbsp; And the fact that it is a sibling should make it even easier than if the babysitter were a stranger.&nbsp; While I understand that a 15 year old might not feel &quot;comfortable&quot; watching his/her siblings while mother is away, almost every family calls on their oldest siblings to help with babysitting on occassion.&nbsp; It&#039;s a very common tactic.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 69th level Warrior, Givins, 65th level Wizard of Inner Loop
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
